# Allowlist: nothing is tracked unless listed here, so credentials, history,
# sessions, memory and local settings can never be committed by accident.
*
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!install.ps1
!sync-settings.ps1
!claude/
!claude/CLAUDE.md
!claude/settings.json
!claude/hooks/
!claude/hooks/**
!claude/templates/
!claude/templates/**
